  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "**BODMAS rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/FLwhwdTkhl3OsusOOieR2hqnYIYtmyfbwf3AsY94UgYZDMIl5MY7UwXqLCGTPPqMRYAUiVWhmOIlJovnEf1lXHB5Or9aHZR_6l8F0jd6Y570tuc9vJ2Js6nhCCWGsi1TQZLG1aSIIiFfrQYR2f2R2A] \n\nGiven equation: 15 + 90 ÷ 9 × 5 – 11 = 28\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers, we get:\n\n1. 11 and 9\n\n15 + **__90 ÷ 11__** × 5 – 9 = 28\n\n⇒ 15 + **__8.18 × 5__** – 9 = 28\n\n⇒ __**15 + 40.9**__ – 9 = 28\n\n⇒ 55.9 - 9 = 28\n\n⇒ 46.9 ≠ R.H.S\n\n2. 15 and 9\n\n9 + __**90 ÷ 15**__ × 5 – 11 = 28\n\n⇒ 9 + __**6 **____**× 5**__ – 11 = 28\n\n⇒ 9 + 30 – 11 = 28\n\n⇒ 39 - 11 = 28\n\n⇒ 28 = R.H.S\n\n3. 15 and 5\n\n5 + __**90 ÷ 9**__ × 15 – 11 = 28\n\n⇒ 5 + __**10 × 15**__ – 11 = 28\n\n⇒ __**5 + 150**__ – 11 = 28\n\n⇒ 155 – 11 = 28\n\n⇒ 144 ≠ R.H.S\n\n4. 9 and 5\n\n15 + __**90 ÷ 5**__ × 9 – 11 = 28\n\n⇒ 15 + __**18 × 9**__ – 11 = 28\n\n⇒ __**15 + 162**__ – 11 = 28\n\n⇒ 177 – 11 = 28\n\n⇒ 166 ≠ R.H.S\n\nHence, '**15 and 9**' is the correct answer.",
